Package: bayesgrove
Title: Graph-Based Bayesian Workflow Scaffolding
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: c(person("Maximilian", "Scholz", email = "dev.scholz@mailbox.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Records Bayesian model reviews: diagnostics create
    obligations that can block downstream computation until a justified
    decision is recorded. Provides typed graph construction, deterministic
    fingerprinting, content-addressed artifact storage, decision logging, a
    summary-driven workflow protocol, and built-in cmdstanr/brms executors for
    HMC, LOO, and posterior-predictive diagnostics.
